<mxfile host="www.iodraw.com" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36" version="24.7.17">
  <diagram name="第 1 页" id="5dE8qhpgHUUBcJzy92js">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1816" dy="509" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="-PYYVq9-8MkDORH9qXDL-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 8); font-size: 7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;[Core Inference Logic &amp;amp; Equivalence Criteria] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;【&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;Must strictly follow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;】&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;To determine the best LCA surrogate or upstream material, you must evaluate the candidates based on LCA substitution principles:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;1. Material Equivalence (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;原料相近&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;):&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;   - A) Core chemical elements/composition equivalence: Does the surrogate provide the same key chemical elements to the system?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;   - B) Physical/Functional attribute equivalence: Does the surrogate provide the same physical function, regardless of exact chemistry?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;2. Process Equivalence (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;工艺相同&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;):&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;   - A) Core transformation mechanism: The substitute must undergo the same physical/chemical transformation principle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;   - B) Unit operations similarity: The core operational steps should be highly similar.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;   - C) Input/Output flow matching: They should have matching primary energy drivers and similar emission types.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;[Examples of Equivalence Application]&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;- Process-based substitution (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;基于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;“&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;工艺&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;的替代&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;):&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;  * Cases: Aggregate -&amp;gt; Sand; Mining waste rock -&amp;gt; Gravel; Sandstone -&amp;gt; Silica sand.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;  * Basis: The core processes are highly consistent (mining, crushing, screening, and transport). In LCA, as long as the process pattern is the same, the resulting environmental load (energy consumption, emissions) spectrum has strong similarity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;- Material-based substitution (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;基于&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;“&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;原料&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;的替代&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;):&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;  * Cases: Iron tailings -&amp;gt; Iron ore; Copper slag -&amp;gt; Copper.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#067d17;&quot;&gt;  * Basis: Although iron tailings are waste and iron ore is a natural resource, in a specific &quot;reaction vessel&quot; (like a cement kiln), both play the role of &quot;element provider&quot; (e.g., providing Fe or Cu). From a material flow perspective, the core input is the element itself.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-170" y="390" width="660" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
